        "Title": "The Pointed Virus",
        "Location": "LOCATION_OPULENT_STINGRAY",
        "PublicId": "126483190243",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Opulent/mission_stingray/scene_stingray_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository e3352213-fc25-4e38-9bed-d44d7dd09809).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to the Maldives 47. Your task is a big one today. Your task is to destroy all evidence of the virus named B-737, or The Cross Virus. It is a very dangerous virus could end the world with its harmful chemicals. The last known trace of it was on Haven Island. We have traced down the individuals responsible for the creation and current owners of The Cross Virus. They are all currently staying in their penthouses. Eliminate all three of them and save the planet. Good luck 47.",
